{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"余端"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"余端"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>余端是"},{"Local":{"url":"端","text":"端"}},{"Plain":"的对偶概念.</p>\n<h3>与测度积分的类比</h3>\n<p>对于函子 $F\\colon \\mathcal C\\to \\mathsf{Set}$, $G\\colon \\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathsf{Set}$, 余端\n$$\r\n\\int_{c\\in\\mathcal C} F(c) \\times G(c)\r\n$$\n可视为可测空间上的函数对测度积分的类比或"},{"Local":{"url":"范畴化","text":"范畴化"}},{"Plain":", 其中 $F$ 是 “被积函数”, $G$ 是 “测度”.\n这个余端也可理解为"},{"Local":{"url":"代函子","text":"代函子"}},{"Plain":" $F\\colon 1\\to \\mathcal C$ 与 $G\\colon \\mathcal C\\to 1$ 的复合, 也即"},{"Local":{"url":"充实范畴上的模","text":"模"}},{"Plain":"的张量积. (当然, 这里的范畴也可以改成 $\\mathcal V$-"},{"Local":{"url":"充实范畴","text":"充实范畴"}},{"Plain":", $\\mathsf{Set}$ 改成 $\\mathcal V$.)</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"可表函子","text":"可表函子"}},{"Plain":" $G = \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,X)$ 是 “delta 分布” 的类比,\n$$\r\n\\int_{c\\in \\mathcal C} F(c) \\times \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,X) \\simeq F(X).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>作为余等化子</h3>\n<p>函子 $F\\colon \\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\times\\mathcal C\\to\\mathsf{Set}$ 的余端是如下的"},{"Local":{"url":"余等化子","text":"余等化子"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\n\\int_{\\mathcal{C}}F = \\operatorname{coeq}\\Big(\r\n    \\coprod_{X\\to Y} F(X,Y) \\rightrightarrows \\coprod_{X}F(X,X)\r\n\\Big).\r\n$$</p>\n<h3>作为余极限</h3>\n<p>函子 $F\\colon \\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\times\\mathcal C\\to\\mathsf{Set}$ 的余端是以"},{"Local":{"url":"扭箭头范畴","text":"扭箭头范畴"}},{"Plain":"为指标的"},{"Local":{"url":"余极限","text":"余极限"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\n\\int_{\\mathcal C} F = \\operatorname{colim}_{(X\\to Y)\\in\\mathsf{TwArr}(\\mathcal C)} F(X,Y).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n"}]}}